This directory contains all the implemented programs/simulation/tools.

Tools:
   GenerateState: Generate the initial state file.
   GenerateCSCS: Convert state file to CSCS Paraview visualisation hdf5 file.

Simulations:
   DynamoRun: Full MHD dynamo simulation
   MagnetoConvectionRun: Magneto-convection simulation.
   ThermalConvectionRun: Thermal convection simulation
